{"data": [{"id": "2122125284719620488", "author_id": "276786713", "text": "@kimmonismus impossible probably a bait to download something malicious", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:31:09.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Youssefyamani/status/2122125284719620488", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122122558879527333", "author_id": "1657512825848209409", "text": "@kimmonismus .kkrieger, game 2004 /3d/ 96kb = https://t.co/KgzPZoAbeo\n.kkrieger é um jogo de tiro em primeira pessoa (FPS) 3D famoso por ocupar apenas 96 KB (97.280 bytes) de espaço em disco. Criado em 2004 pelo grupo alemão da demoscene .theprodukkt (uma subdivisão da Farbrausch), https://t.co/x3JsCyT14N", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:20:19.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/mbenignosss/status/2122122558879527333", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122122268843126874", "author_id": "2416617241", "text": "@kimmonismus I built one just today in a single 88kb html file. But i won't give you a link.", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:19:10.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/R0bert__Pauls0n/status/2122122268843126874", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122121284733530347", "author_id": "1191048883243278343", "text": "@LexoWalker @kimmonismus Ask claude", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:15:16.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/AndresDowning/status/2122121284733530347", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122115162807124191", "author_id": "1826745977891430400", "text": "@kimmonismus 97 KB is the part that gets me. That's smaller than most website hero images. Curious how it holds up once someone asks it to change one thing without breaking the rest.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T23:50:56.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/TechTvCh/status/2122115162807124191", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122098557255655831", "author_id": "1912413089779314688", "text": "@kimmonismus I think you mean GB", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:44:57.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/me____myself_/status/2122098557255655831", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122094033124356221", "author_id": "1712024908903981056", "text": "@kimmonismus I have the entire milkyway Galaxy generated in 20kb.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:26:58.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/FinamistHq/status/2122094033124356221", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122093267156193324", "author_id": "1535992489747922944", "text": "@williamclay @kimmonismus 🤣 painfully accurate. 97 KB for a whole ocean and it still looks better than most landing pages I've shipped", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:23:56.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/aiclicklight/status/2122093267156193324", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122092290147831945", "author_id": "1106468274370277377", "text": "@kimmonismus This is really, really cool, is there anyway to experience this in stereoscopic 3-D in VR?", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:20:03.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/BieverSean/status/2122092290147831945", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122090113689641296", "author_id": "1720665183188922368", "text": "@germ_nation_ @kimmonismus It really is. A few tens of thousands of bytes of shaders and generation math expand at runtime into millions of kelp fronds, a full shipwreck, schools of fish, manta rays, caustics, and synthesized audio. Computation instead of assets.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:11:24.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2122090113689641296", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122089992193556838", "author_id": "1977963322197856256", "text": "@grok @kimmonismus That’s remarkable", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:10:55.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/germ_nation_/status/2122089992193556838", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122089114548011251", "author_id": "4158642497", "text": "@kimmonismus + 10 GB for the unreal engine binaries", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:07:26.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/itsmecalcifers/status/2122089114548011251", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122088563852423437", "author_id": "1720665183188922368", "text": "@germ_nation_ @kimmonismus Yes. The complete project is one self-contained index.html file measuring 99,514 bytes (~97.2 KB). \n\nEverything—WebGPU shaders, procedural geometry for the kelp, ship, fish, rays, seabed, and Web Audio synthesis—is generated at runtime from code inside that single file. No", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:05:14.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2122088563852423437", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122088537214640549", "author_id": "2119584862600409088", "text": "@kimmonismus Show repo or stop lying", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:05:08.000Z", "url": "https://x